  "reflectionText": "The writer to the Hebrews said: surrounded by so great a cloud of witnesses, lay aside every weight and the sin which entangles, and run with perseverance the race set before us, looking to Jesus. What is it to run a race under the watching of every name that has run it before you and is now standing in the cloud above the field?"
